1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,660
Man: I've been having trouble with my car lately

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:06,280
It makes a weird sound every time I start it.

3
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:11,230
Woman: That's annoying. Have you taken it to get checked out?

4
00:00:11,230 --> 00:00:16,100
Man: Not yet. I'm planning to go tomorrow.

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:23,020
Woman: That's a good idea. It might be something minor, but it's better to be safe.

6
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:27,864
Man: Exactly. I just pray it doesn't cost me an arm and a leg.

7
00:00:27,864 --> 00:00:31,380
And I hope to get my car back by Sunday

8
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:35,130
I need to pick up my mother at the airport then.

9
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:38,030
​​​​​​​Woman: Fingers crossed!
